    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Push to Win</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can pressing a button be <i>that</i> fun? The answer: Yes.</strong><br>&quot;Push to Win&quot; throws you into a unique arena of competition and strategy. All you need to do is press the button... but it\u2019s not as simple as it looks. Winning takes clever moves, perfect timing, and maybe a bit of luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're playing casually with friends or going head-to-head in tense matchups, this game proves how deep simple mechanics can truly be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With minimalist yet stylized graphics, smooth controls, and dynamic gameplay that changes every round, &quot;Push to Win&quot; keeps calling you back for one more match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Can I Expect From This Game?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced and competitive gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple mechanics that are easy to learn, hard to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laugh-out-loud moments when playing with friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surprising outcomes and unique dynamics in every match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bright, clean visuals in an eye-friendly, colorful environment</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why Should I Buy This Game?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm developing the game solo, and your support will help make it even better</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I need funding to add more game modes, characters, and maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your help allows me to keep improving and delivering updates quickly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're looking for something fun, addictive, and endlessly replayable\u2014this is it</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Push to Win</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can pressing a button be <i>that</i> fun? The answer: Yes.</strong><br>&quot;Push to Win&quot; throws you into a unique arena of competition and strategy. All you need to do is press the button... but it\u2019s not as simple as it looks. Winning takes clever moves, perfect timing, and maybe a bit of luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're playing casually with friends or going head-to-head in tense matchups, this game proves how deep simple mechanics can truly be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With minimalist yet stylized graphics, smooth controls, and dynamic gameplay that changes every round, &quot;Push to Win&quot; keeps calling you back for one more match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Can I Expect From This Game?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced and competitive gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple mechanics that are easy to learn, hard to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laugh-out-loud moments when playing with friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surprising outcomes and unique dynamics in every match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bright, clean visuals in an eye-friendly, colorful environment</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why Should I Buy This Game?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm developing the game solo, and your support will help make it even better</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I need funding to add more game modes, characters, and maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your help allows me to keep improving and delivering updates quickly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're looking for something fun, addictive, and endlessly replayable\u2014this is it</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Get ready to compete in this fun 8-player party game full of puzzles and tricky obstacles! Each player must both cooperate and compete to outsmart the others. Jump, solve, push, and win\u2014but watch out, rivals may try to sabotage you every round!",
